%% UC-15 View the AI prep forecast — FR-31 (ADR-0004). Added after the Lab 5 peer review.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Restaurant staff
  participant API as /restaurants/:id/forecast (route)
  participant AUTH as Auth & Access Control
  participant FC as Forecast Component
  participant FD as forecast model (domain)
  participant DB as Repositories
  participant LLM as LLM Adapter (optional)
  participant AN as Anthropic API

  S->>API: GET forecast
  API->>AUTH: authenticate + requireRole(STAFF) + own restaurant scope
  AUTH-->>API: principal
  API->>FC: getForecast(principal, restaurantId)
  FC->>DB: daily quantities per dish, last 35 days (aggregates only, no customer data)
  DB-->>FC: rows
  FC->>FD: weekday-weighted average + trend, range, confidence, 7-day backtest
  FD-->>FC: dishes, totals, accuracy
  FC->>FC: templateSummary(forecast)
  alt ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set and history exists
    FC->>LLM: complete(prompt with dish numbers only)
    LLM->>AN: Messages API (8 s timeout)
    alt answered
      AN-->>LLM: ≤ 3 sentences
      LLM-->>FC: summary
    else error or timeout
      AN-->>LLM: error
      LLM-->>FC: error — keep the template summary, log it
    end
  end
  FC->>DB: audit FORECAST_VIEWED (summary source)
  FC-->>API: forecast + summary + "advice only"
  API-->>S: 200 forecast
  note over S,AN: Advice only: nothing here accepts orders or changes payments, eligibility or the menu.
